cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Ragnostics"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ledostxx/ragnostics"
authors:
  - family-names: Dost
    given-names: Leonard
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit app for the qualitative failure analysis of RAG
  (retrieval-augmented generation) systems. A reviewer reads benchmark traces
  one at a time and writes free-text observations (open coding). An LLM then
  proposes failure categories from the notes, which the reviewer edits, assigns
  and freezes as a codebook (axial coding). A small adapter file translates
  each system's logs into a common record format.
keywords:
  - rag
  - evaluation
  - qualitative-coding
  - llm
